{
  "slug": "progress",
  "name": "Progress",
  "title": "进度条",
  "category": "base",
  "files": [
    "components/progress/progress.tsx"
  ],
  "description": "基于 React Aria ProgressBar 的进度指示：线性进度条与环形进度，支持确定与不确定状态、标签与数值、多种色调和尺寸。",
  "keywords": [
    "progress",
    "progress bar",
    "ring",
    "circular",
    "loading",
    "upload",
    "进度",
    "进度条",
    "环形进度",
    "上传"
  ],
  "exports": [
    "Progress",
    "ProgressRing"
  ],
  "demos": [
    {
      "file": "progress/overview.tsx",
      "title": "概览",
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "file": "progress/ring.tsx",
      "title": "环形进度",
      "description": "中心默认显示百分比，也可以通过 children 放入自定义内容。",
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "file": "progress/sizes.tsx",
      "title": "色调与尺寸",
      "height": 280
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "没有可见 label 时请传 aria-label。",
    "isIndeterminate 用于无法预估时长的任务；数值格式可以通过 formatOptions 或 valueLabel 定制。",
    "进度变化带 500ms 的平滑过渡，减少动态效果时自动关闭。"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "component": "Progress",
      "description": "其余属性透传给 React Aria ProgressBar（value、minValue、maxValue、isIndeterminate、formatOptions、valueLabel 等）。",
      "props": [
        {
          "name": "label",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "可见标签。"
        },
        {
          "name": "description",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "进度条下方的说明。"
        },
        {
          "name": "showValue",
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": "有 label 时为 true",
          "description": "在标签行末显示数值。"
        },
        {
          "name": "tone",
          "type": "\"accent\" | \"success\" | \"warning\" | \"danger\" | \"neutral\"",
          "default": "\"accent\"",
          "description": "颜色。"
        },
        {
          "name": "size",
          "type": "\"sm\" | \"md\" | \"lg\"",
          "default": "\"md\"",
          "description": "轨道粗细 4 / 6 / 10 px。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "component": "ProgressRing",
      "description": "其余属性同 Progress。",
      "props": [
        {
          "name": "size",
          "type": "\"sm\" | \"md\" | \"lg\"",
          "default": "\"md\"",
          "description": "直径 32 / 56 / 96 px。"
        },
        {
          "name": "tone",
          "type": "ProgressTone",
          "default": "\"accent\"",
          "description": "颜色。"
        },
        {
          "name": "showValue",
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": "md / lg 为 true",
          "description": "中心显示数值。"
        },
        {
          "name": "children",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "自定义中心内容。"
        },
        {
          "name": "label",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "环旁边的文字。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
